Model Evaluation

Dataset: 18,618 weakly-labeled notes
Model: Bio_ClinicalBERT (token classification)
Training: 1 epoch (CPU-friendly in Colab)

Results:

Metric	Score
Token Accuracy	99.96%
Evaluation Loss	0.0028
F1-Score*	Approx. near-perfect for labeled tokens

⚠️ Because the labels are weakly-supervised (regex heuristics), accuracy primarily measures consistency with our rule-based labels rather than clinical correctness.

Interpretation:
The model learned the weak labels extremely well. The next step would be adding a small hand-labeled dev set to measure “true” clinical accuracy.

